<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Hona Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Korontiyaya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Kyagha ɗeleewar ɗaɓa ya ahar Mbulus aah na Faara ka a tsauka tǝthlǝnda Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso tǝƙǝm wan manǝm Kastanisu, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />a fatakkwaya Faara na a Koronti, a kun aah na Faara a tsawun nafiyighǝn na chahal hu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. Ƙǝla ǝnanǝn a fiya heu ko a yanggini na a aah thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, yindan Chinǝm tǝ yinǝm. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Ngwa tsauka nggayirha tǝ tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha yi Faara na Chinɗi tǝ Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ kun.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usa Mbulus Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Ƙǝtsar ni naarha usa Faar ka kun, ƙǝsǝr nggayidghǝn fǝrrǝghǝn a kun, tsau nun nanǝnya yi Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Ƙǝsǝr ka nanun hu Ƙǝrǝsti wal ɗun ǝngya na nggǝngga hangga, hu laɓara tǝ sǝndǝ nun heu, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />ndǝn kyadgha ndaarha ˈya pǝrang ni kun aten Ƙǝrǝsti ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Nanǝn kee ƙǝɗeng nggun fǝrra sǝsǝna nanun a ƙǝla wutta Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti fa ɓa a kukwasang kun fa wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Nǝn a ƙǝs kun ha ngga non kanglang kula ǝn ˈyaara a fad nun ta farɗa ɗǝ na Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti a wutta ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Faara ndǝn na a ǝna ǝnɗiya, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn tǝ ƙǝkafek fa a ǝna ǝnɗa nǝn ndanǝn, ƙǝmɗa aah ɗǝ kun a mbǝn ndan nun fa tǝ Wanggǝn, Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsakhrha hai ahu ƙǝn hwan Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Hwanni kun, hu thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, a tsawun ɗǝɗem tǝ ndan. Ana tsakhrha sǝ a pathlang nun wa. A meyedghǝn a nagha mii nun tal. Wuma ma teena ngga, nagha numad nun tal tǝ ˈya na mid nun ǝnaarha tal. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ƙǝsǝr fingya nafiya ɓagha ɓa a wuri ki Kuluwi pǝrenda ndaarha a pǝpal, shayina, nuwun a yanda tǝ ndan. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />ˈYa niya ndaarha, fingya a ndaarha, “Nggi yi Mbulus ni,” fingya a ndaarha, “Nggi yi Apolos ni,” fingya a ndaarha ƙǝm, “Nggi yi Mbiturus ni,” nduwa, “Nggi yi Ƙǝrǝsti ni.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Ndee tsakh Ƙǝrǝsti hai wa? Mbulus ni tawang nanda ɗǝ ka kun wa? Nduwa ǝnangganda Mbaptisǝma kun hu thlǝm Mbulus wa? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Usaɗi Faara ǝnang ngwa ni mbaptisǝma niifa tal ahur nun, kǝl Ƙǝribus tǝ Nggayus, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />nanǝnya mbǝ niifa sǝ na ndaarha ǝnangganda mbaptisǝma kanda hu thlǝmna wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Haˈi, ǝnangɗi mbaptisǝma nafiya wuri Istifanus ma, amma a mbǝ fingya yini ya wa mbi sǝnda tǝ ǝnangɗi mbaptisǝma niifa pak wa.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ai, thlǝn ngwa Ƙǝrǝsti nggi ɓa ka ɓi ǝna mbaptisǝma wa. Thlǝn nǝn nggi ɓa ka ɓi pǝr Laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn, mbǝ tǝ thladwayid sǝnda niifa wa, ka tǝrǝmnda naɗǝ fiya tsǝ teena aten sǝsǝmnda mǝrra Ƙǝrǝsti aten kaɗiirha.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƙǝrǝsti Sǝsǝmnda tǝ thladwayid Faara ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Laɓar mǝrra Ƙǝrǝsti aten kaɗiirha, laɓar nuryirha ni a fingya na hu kwaman sahatta, amma ƙǝm walgha hǝrǝkrha sǝnɗǝmsǝ sǝsǝmnda Faara ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai tǝ ndaarha “Niya tsawang thladwayid niifa na ndǝndǝl mere, tǝ ƙǝmɗa niya ɗǝfang sǝnda fingya na tǝ sǝnda fa kaan man patu ɗǝ.” <verse eid="1CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Ai nafini na ndǝndǝl? Ai famalǝmngya ngyakhrha? Ai fingya na a ndaarha sǝnda ˈya? Kyad wa Faara ndaarha thladwayid ƙǝshidɗiya nuryirha ni wa? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Nanǝn kee, ahu thladwayid Faara, ahu thladwayid ƙǝshiirha sǝngwa ndan wa. Mbǝnang ɗǝ Faara ahu nuryid pǝr laɓarɗi ka a hǝrghanggǝn fingya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Yahudaya kanda a kaɗa ǝnsakhkya, Helenaya ƙǝmɗa kanda a kaɗa thladwayirha, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Ƙǝm a pǝr laɓar Ƙǝrǝsti mǝrgha aten kaɗiirha, mbǝnang ngwa Yahudaya wa, Helenaya a ndaarha ƙǝmɗa mbǝ ka ˈya ni wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Amma fingya aah na Faara kanda hu hǝrǝkrha ɓa, Yahudaya tǝ Helenaya kyab, Ƙǝrǝsti ndǝna sǝsǝmnda Faara tǝƙǝm thladwayid Faara. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Ahu ˈya nǝm a ƙǝlang nda tar nuryirha ni ǝnana Faara ya kalɗǝ ndǝndǝlyid thladwayid niifa mu, mǝrra fad Faara hai kalɗǝ kanglanggid niifa mu. <verse eid="1CO 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Shayina, ɗalama teena hai a sayidɗi aah nanda kun. Mbuwun hangga na ndǝndǝl hu yid fiya hu ƙǝshidɗiya, mbuwun hangga na mamngya wa, mbuwun hangga na wangya mamngya wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />A meyedghǝn Faara nǝn wur ǝngya ƙǝlang na ƙǝshiirha ǝn nuryirha ni ƙǝsǝr ka fǝrang shilee nǝn fingya ndagha na nda ndǝndǝl, tǝƙǝm nǝn wur ǝngya mbuwa tǝ sǝsǝmnda fa ka fǝrang shilee nǝn fingya ndagha na nda tǝ sǝsǝmnda ha. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Faara wurɗǝ ǝngya karna ƙǝshiirha, tǝ ǝngya ndǝɗang ngwa ƙǝshiirha, ka a kyaɗanggǝnǝn ƙǝshiirha ǝnɗi ƙǝlang nanda ka ˈyani mbǝ ˈyani a yidghǝn wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Nanǝn kee, mbǝ niifasǝ na taala a mbed Faara wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Wumang Faara kun tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. Tsang Faara Ƙǝrǝsti a tsauka thladwayid nǝm, A fadghǝn ni na wal nǝm nggayid Faara fa, tǝ tsaurha chahal tǝ wal pǝla. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Nanǝn kee ƙǝla ndana ɗeleewar Faara, “Kala niifa na midghǝn taala tǝta ni a talgha tǝ ˈya ǝnana Chinǝm.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Laɓara aten Ƙǝrǝsti tawang nanda ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />A sayidɗi ɓani thlǝmad nun ɓa shayina, pǝranggi laɓar Faara kun na ɓǝɓee tǝ mbang mee tǝ thladwayirha wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />A sayidɗi tsauni tǝ kun, mbǝ ˈya sǝ na minna wa, ƙǝl laɓar Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ mǝrrǝghǝn aten kaɗiirha. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Ɓani thlǝmad nun ɓa, mǝr fadna hai, fadna a rǝprha fa kaan tǝ tǝrǝmnda, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />tsahad na ha tǝ pǝr laɓar Faara ǝnani nǝghǝn a pǝpal. Mbǝ tǝ thladwayid thlufarha tǝ mbang nda mee wa, mbǝrsayi tǝ sǝsǝmnda Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Tsaha ni ha tǝ pǝr Laɓar Faara kee ƙǝsǝr amana fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun naarha aten thladwayid niifa amma hu sǝsǝmnda Faara.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǝr Sǝsǝna Thladwayid Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />A naɗi ahur nafiya shingga hu fǝrƙǝkafek, ni tsǝ laɓara tǝ thladwayirha, amma mbǝ tur thladwayid ƙǝshiirha wa, nduwa a kutǝrya yi ƙǝshiirha mbuwa kwas mbǝtta wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Amma thladwayid ɗi ni a thlǝkrha ya thladwayid Faara ni na ɓǝɓee. Thladwayidghǝn yi wulteena ni na ɓǝɓee. Ənagha Faara ndǝn kapa na nda ǝna ƙǝshiirha ka mamnggid nǝm. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Amma kutǝrya ƙǝshiid weeriya kukwalang ngwa nda hai wa; andam kukwalang nda hai kam tawang ngwanda Chinǝm ɗǝ tǝ mamnggid wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ƙǝla nanǝn chichireethlee hai, “Mbǝ yirha sǝ nagha ndǝn wa, mbǝ thlǝmarha sǝ sǝkka ndǝn wa, tǝƙǝm mbǝ huteena sǝ numagha ndǝn wa, ǝngginiya ndǝn ǝnana Faara a fingya nggǝmngga ndǝn.” <verse eid="1CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Amma a ƙǝmni pǝr na Faara ǝnggini ˈyahu Sǝsǝnggǝn. Ƙǝsǝr Sǝsǝnggǝn ndǝn kaɗagha ǝngya heu na ɓǝɓee kuɗimnggǝn yi Faara. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ na sǝn numad niifa wa, ƙǝl sǝsǝn niifɗi tafadghǝn, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm mbǝ niifa sǝ na sǝn numad Faara wa ƙǝl Sǝsǝn Faara. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Thlǝɗǝm Sǝsǝn Faara, mbǝ sǝsǝn ƙǝshiirha wa, tǝnǝm sǝn ǝngya fǝrangna Faara ƙǝm. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Nanan a pǝrang ǝnggini kun ya, mbǝm a ndikrha tǝ thladwayid thlu farha wa. A meyedghǝn, nan a ndikrha tǝ laɓaara fǝrang na Sǝsǝna kan, nan a ǝna taara tǝ laɓar Sǝsǝna ndǝn nan a pǝr ƙǝkafekkid Sǝsǝna. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Niifa mbuwana sǝsǝnɗi tǝghǝn fa, mbǝ thlǝ ǝngya yi Sǝsǝn Faara wa. Ƙǝsǝr ǝn nuryirha ni a fadghǝn tǝƙǝm mbǝ sǝnang kanda hai wa, ƙǝsǝr tǝ Sǝsǝna ni nǝm sǝnggǝn. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Niifa na tǝ sǝsǝn ɗi nǝn mbang ƙǝƙǝrang ǝngya heu, amma niifa mbuwa tǝ sǝsǝn ɗi mbǝ niifa sǝ na mbang ƙǝƙǝrang wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Ƙǝsǝr, “Wunni sǝn numad Chinǝm? Wun sǝngga ˈya ngga na mbang tsahang ha?” Amma ƙǝm numad nǝm yi Ƙǝrǝsti ni.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Tsakhrha hai hu ƙǝn hwan Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Shayina, a sayidɗi nani tǝ kun mbiyi a kalang kunsǝ ƙǝla nafiya na tǝ sǝsǝna wa. Niyi a kalang kunsǝ ƙǝla nafiya na yi ƙǝshidɗiya nduwa nuwun ƙǝla wufar waya hu Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Kǝrɗi kun tǝ mbee, mbǝ tǝ yaarha wa, ƙǝsǝr ngwa wun fa tǝ ˈya na kakrak wa. Pa nanǝnya ɓal wun kula ngwarha fa. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ɓalwun tǝ tar thlu farha ha. A naɗun a sǝrǝkrha, kun a yanda tǝ ndan, ndǝn kyadgha ndaarha mbun tǝ sǝsǝn ɗi wa, nuwun ƙǝla nafiya ƙǝshidɗiya. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />A nda niifa ahur nun “Nggi niyi takkwa Mbulus,” yanɗi ƙǝm a ndaarha, “Nggi niyi takkwa Apolos,” mbǝ nuwun a ǝnaarha ƙǝla nafiya ƙǝshidɗiya wa? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Akwasamadghǝn, wunni Apolos? Wunni Mbulus? Ƙǝm mafaya Faara ni kee ahurghǝn ni thlǝ nun Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn. Kowunni ahur nǝm ǝnaɗǝ tarɗi fǝrang na Chinǝm ƙǝm. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Nggi ndǝn hǝfangga wiidɗa hai. Apolos ndǝn irangga aama mu. Amma Faara ndǝn na tsang sǝ. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Nanǝn kee, mbǝ niifɗi hǝfgha ndǝn tǝ yanɗi irangga aama ndǝn ǝnagha ˈya wa, amma Faara na a tsang ǝngya sǝ heu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Nda tǝ hǝfrha, tǝ yanɗi irgha aama mu na numad ndan tal, nanda a wal ƙǝna tar ndan mǝmǝl hu tar ndan. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Ƙǝsǝr kan kyab fa tarya Faara ni, kun ndǝna hed Faara, tǝnda Faara. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Ƙǝsǝr ka nggayid Faara na a tenna, nggini mbuhangga tǝndǝɗa hai ƙǝla tǝ mbang tǝnda. Nanǝnya fingya ni a njirha sǝ. Amma kala niifa na a njirha sǝ tǝta ni a kwargha. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Mbǝ niifasǝ pak na nggǝr mbukh tǝndǝɗa hai ma yanɗi ˈwa nanda mbuhwang hai wa, ndǝna Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Kala niifa njigha aten mbukh tǝndǝɗiya tǝ tǝfasa, nduwa tǝ wurirha, nduwa tǝ ferya na nggǝngga, nduwa tǝ ɗǝfrha nduwa tǝ hwaliirha nduwa tǝ kofa, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />amma a far ngwa kumarha, na nda kuchiɓang kala tur taara ǝnana tǝtǝndǝɗi pǝpal sǝ. Tǝ waarha na nda ƙǝƙǝrang tur nggayid tar niifa. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />A ɓal tǝndǝɗi sǝ, na tǝtǝndǝɗi a wal ƙǝnaghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />A i tarɗaɗǝ, mbǝ ˈyasǝ na tǝtǝndǝɗi a waala wa. Amma na tǝ tǝtǝndǝɗi a wal hǝrǝkrha, amma ƙǝla niifa hǝrǝkka tǝ hur sheneu waarha. <verse eid="1CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Sǝnggunsǝ kun tafad nun wuri Faarani, tǝƙǝm Sǝsǝn Faara nǝghǝn ahur nun wa? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />A sǝɓang niifa Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ, na Faara a ɓǝlang nda niifɗi. Ƙǝsǝr Ƙǝn Faara nǝghǝn chahal, kun tafad nun Ƙǝn Faara ni. <verse eid="1CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />A nggaɓa niifa fadghǝn hai wa. A nanna a numad ndaarha na ndǝndǝl ƙǝla nana ƙǝshiirha, tsang fadwa nurghǝn tǝna ɓa tsaurha ndǝndǝl, <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />ƙǝsǝr thladwayid ƙǝshidɗiya nuryirha ni hu yid Faara. Ƙǝla nanǝn chichireethlee hai, “Nǝn ƙǝsang thladwayid niifa hu ndǝndǝlyid ndan.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Tǝ ƙǝm, “Chinǝm sǝnɗasǝ numad nafiya na ndǝndǝl ka ni kee.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Nanǝn kee a talɗun aten niifa wa. Ƙǝsǝr ǝngya heu yinun ni, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />ko Mbulus, nduwa Apolos, nduwa Mbiturus, nduwa ƙǝshiirha, nduwa yibrha, nduwa mǝrra, nduwa ǝngya nanǝnya, nduwa ǝngya na ɓayi. Ənggini heu ya yinun ni, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />kun yi Ƙǝrǝsti ni, Ƙǝrǝsti ƙǝm yi Faara ni.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Tar fathlǝngya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Numama aten nan tǝ ndaarha fatarya Ƙǝrǝsti ni kan, ɗǝfang nanda kan aten ƙǝkafekkid Faara na ɓǝɓee. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Niifa ɗǝfang nanda aten ˈya kamɗǝ a tsauka tǝ ƙǝkafek fa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />ˈYani ngguchit a fanna a ngwe ɗun kumarha sǝ nduwa ngwa kumad niifa. Nggi ma ngwang nggi kumarha altenna wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Ndawi ko ǝnaɗi ˈya mbuwa ngga wa, mbi ndaarha ƙǝm ǝnaɗi ˈya na ngga wa. Chinǝm ndǝn na a ngwe kumarha sǝ. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Nanǝn kee a ˈwaɗun teena ngwang kumarha nun niifa farghǝn kula ɓarhaɓa wa, ƙǝlama wutta Chinǝm fa ɓa. Ndǝghǝn ni na a kyang ǝngya ƙǝshaaɓa na ɓǝɓee hu wula, chalǝm numad kowunni nǝn. A mbǝɗaniya na kowunni a wal faala kamngga a har Faara. <verse eid="1CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Shayina, ƙǝsǝr ka kun ni ǝnani taara tǝ Apolos tǝ nggi a tsauka ǝnsakhrha, ka tsahanggǝn kun ha tǝma na laɓarɗi na chichireethlee hai a ndaarha, “A mbǝrang ɗun ǝnɗa hai chireethleng nanda hai wa.” Na minnasǝ a malanggun ndaarha tal ahur nan kalɗǝ shadghǝn mu. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Wunni ndowa kalna fingya? Mbǝ Faara ni furowa ǝngya nana tǝghǝn ha wa? Anaɗǝ kee kama na a taala aten ǝngya nana tǝghǝn ha ƙǝla mbǝ Faara fǝrowa ndǝn wa? <verse eid="1CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Nuwun a numad ndaarha ˈwaɗun teena wal ɗun ǝngya na mid nun. Nuwun a numad ndaarha nanǝnya ˈwaɗun teena tsauɗun faƙǝnaya. Katǝrang ɗun tsau kutǝryirha hai hu kutǝryid Faara kula kan. A ndam kwang katǝrang ɗun tsau kutǝryirha hai, ƙǝl tsau kutǝryirha nǝm heu tǝ kun. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Niyi a numarha naghǝn ƙǝla kyad na Faara ndǝn a pǝpal tǝ ndaarha kan fathlǝngya Yeeso ɗǝnggǝl mee ni ahu ǝngya heu, ƙǝla porsǝnaya ƙǝsang nanda kanda hu yanda ɗǝna nda ɓǝlang kanda, tsau ɗan ƙǝshiirha heu njang nda yirha kan fa, fathlǝngya Faara tǝ fiya. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Nurya ni ƙǝm ka nanǝm hu Ƙǝrǝsti, amma kun nuwun ndǝndǝl tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti. Mbǝ kanglanggirha sǝ a fad nan wa, amma kun nuwun tǝ kanglanggirha fa. Sarang nda kan ɗǝ, amma kun manang nda kun. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Nanǝnya ma miirha a ƙǝs kan tǝ hushimnda, kukwasharya ni a fad nan, kanda a ɗǝk kan tǝƙǝm mbǝ wuri nan sǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Kan a ǝna taara ngga tǝ har nan. A shiwang nda kan nan ɗǝfang parka kanda teena, a sǝsang nda kan nan ƙǝrǝsta. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />A thlǝk nafiya ˈya mbuwa ngga aten nan, kan nan thlǝk ˈya na ngga aten ndan, nan ƙǝla ten kirǝfrha hu yid ƙǝshiirha tǝ ƙǝm nan ƙǝla ɗeng ngwa mbǝrha hu yid fiya heu pa weeri ɗaɓa ya. <verse eid="1CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Mbǝ ka a fǝrang shilee ni kun chireethleng ni kun ɗǝ wa, amma a ƙǝs thlǝmad nun ni kun ƙǝla wanggina nggǝmni. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ko nuwun narha tǝ fatsahaya ha kumnggit kum hu Ƙǝrǝsti amma mbuwun tǝ chingya hangga wa, ƙǝsǝr nggini chinun hu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso pǝr ni Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn a kun. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ƙǝsǝr kee, niya hwan kun, tsahama tǝ nggi. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Ƙǝsǝr ndǝghǝn ɗani, thlǝnang ni Timoti kun ɗǝ waana na tǝ ƙǝkafek fa nggǝmni hu Ƙǝrǝsti, nǝn a ɗalang kwaman takkwa Ƙǝrǝsti kun teena, ƙǝla tsaha ni ha hu ƙǝn hwan Faara ko a yanggi ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Fingya ahur nun kanda a taala, ƙǝla mbiya nggǝr wutta thlǝmad nun ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Amma tsǝɓaku a nggǝm Faara fa niya nggǝr wutta thlǝmad nun ɗǝ, ɗi na nafini na a tǝrang tendan sǝ, tǝ sǝsǝmnda mani sǝ a fad ndan. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ƙǝsǝr kutǝryid Faara mbǝ laɓaara ahu mee kee wa, amma yi sǝsǝmnda ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Yanggi na minnun? A ɓee ɓa tǝ wutǝteerha ka a tsǝtsǝl kun ni wa, nduwa ɓee ɓa tǝ hur nggǝmnda tǝ sǝsǝn sammayirha wa?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Kar Mbulus kulafayirha fa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Pǝrendan nǝghǝn kee tǝ ndaarha ahur nun na fingya sǝ na a ǝna kulafayirha, kamngwa a nagha sǝ ko ahur nafiya sǝngwa Faara wa. Nagha niifa a hunaarha hai tǝ nu chin. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Non a taala tǝghǝn, amma kamɗǝ nagha ǝn sǝbrha hura ni tǝ ǝn shilee, Rǝghaman niifɗa ɗǝ ya ma hur nun. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ko nanǝn mbi a thlǝmad nun nanǝnya wa, niyi a thlǝmad nun hu sǝsǝna. Ahu thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso ˈwaɗi teena ngwang ɗi kumarha niifɗi ǝnagha ǝnɗiya, ƙǝla niyi a thlǝmad nun. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Sayidɗi wum nun hai hu thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso, niyi a thlǝmad nun hu sǝsǝna tǝ sǝsǝmnda yi Chinǝm Yeeso, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Fǝrama niifɗiya a Sheetan tǝna fadɗi keeghǝn na ɗimi mǝra na a walgha yiɓǝdghǝn hǝrǝkrha a fara na Chinǝm a wutta ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Mbǝ tallǝ nun ngga wa. Ashe, sǝnggun sǝ mekhna ngguchit a kurɗang ɗǝm tǝ humbarha nǝn safang heu wa? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Iraman hur mehen ɗimiyid ɗaɗǝ, tǝnun tsaurha chahal. Tǝrgha nun a tsaurha ƙǝla weerinda mburodi ǝnana nda kula mekhna, ƙǝla sǝnni nuwun kee. Ƙǝsǝr Ƙǝrǝsti tsauka wan kamnda Wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha, ǝnanda sataka sǝ. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Tsaunǝn kee, tama ǝna wutsǝfayidɗa nǝm mbǝ tǝ mburodi yi hura mekhna yi kar ndan fa tǝ mbǝlfeerha wa, amma tǝ weerinda mburodi na kula mekhna na ngga yi ƙǝkafek, <verse eid="1CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />ˈwa ni chireethleng kun ɗǝ kaar yi, ndanggi kun a wum ɗun teena tǝ nafiya na a ǝna kulafayirha wa. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Mbiyi a ndaarha fingya fǝrwa ƙǝkafek na a ǝna ɗimiyid kulafayirha, tǝ suna, tǝ ngaara, tǝ takkwa ɗaharha wa. Anaɗǝ kee kǝl tǝtani a mal ƙǝshidɗa nun ya. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Amma nanǝnya niya chirethleng kun ɗǝ tǝ ndaarha a tam ɗun wum teena tǝ niifa ndagha ƙǝrǝsta ni mbǝ nagha ǝna kulafayirha, tǝ suna, tǝ takkwa ɗaharha, tǝ ˈyar farha, tǝ tǝnggal mbaala, tǝ ngaara, a kyaɗun hǝb ǝnnarhami tǝ tur nafini ya wa. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Ma djiɗegha tǝ ngwang kumarha fingya mbuwa yinǝm? Mbǝ fingya na ahur nǝm ndǝ nun ngwang kumarha kanda sǝ wa? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Faara ndǝn na ngwang kumarha fingya mbuwa yinǝm. Ndagha Ɗeleewar Faara, rǝghama tǝmbǝlfedɗi ya ahur nun.<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">A huhwa ɗun ndan wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ana ˈyasǝ a pathlang nun tǝ shadwa ƙǝrǝsta, kama nun ɗǝrha thlǝmad fa yamid ƙǝkafekkya ɗǝ ngwang kumarha nda kun sǝ? A meyedghǝn mani mbuwa nun ɗǝrha mbed nafiya Faara ɗǝ na chahal? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Nduwa sǝnggun sǝ na nafiya Faara na chahal ni a ngwang kumarha ƙǝshiirha wa? Ana kunni a ngwang kumarha ƙǝshiirha, tsǝk kun na a ngwa kumarha nun aten ˈya ngguchit wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Sǝnggun sǝ tǝ ndaarha nǝm ngwang kumarha fathlǝngya Faara sǝ wa? Sakwata ǝngya tsauka yi tsawud ƙǝshidɗi ya wa! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Ana ǝn huhwarha sǝ, kama nun ɗǝrha tǝghǝn mbed fangwa kumaya ɗǝ mbuwa nafiya Faara? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Pǝr ni ndǝn kee ka a kyon hu shilee hai. Mbǝ niif nun narha sǝ na tǝ thladwayirha ahur nun na mbang ngwang kumarha kun sǝ a pathlang nun tǝ ndan Ƙǝrǝstaya wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Amma a meyedghǝn na niifa huhwa shadghǝn a mbed nafiya fǝrwa ƙǝkafek! <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />A huhwa ɗun ndan a mbǝɗiya kyadɗǝ ndaarha ˈwaɗun teena fǝlɗun hai kaan. Mbǝ nggushi nggǝmang na ǝnɗi huhwa nanda sa atenggǝn wa? Mbǝ nggushi ƙǝrǝs na huk sa nda wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />A meyedghǝn kun tafad nun ni na a ǝna ˈya mbuwa ngga tǝ ƙǝm non a huk shayi nun fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Sǝnggunsǝ tǝ ndaarha nafiya fa mbǝlfeeya mba nda wal kutǝryid talara wa? A huk ɗun alten nun wa. Fingya na a ǝna ɗimiyid kulafayirha, nduwa fingya na a takkwa ɗaharha, nduwa susuwaya, nduwa hǝshya na a hunarha hai tǝ ndan hǝshya, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />nduwa ngaarya, nduwa nafiya na tǝ suna, nduwa fa sa mbalya, nduwa nafiya na ˈyar farha, nduwa fa fasa farha, ko tǝtal ahur ndan mbusǝ na kyarha hu kutǝryid Faara ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Fingya ahur nun ˈwanda ǝnaarha kee. Amma nanǝnya tsaɓang nda kun ɗǝ, nuwun chahal, tsauɗun mǝmǝl a mbed Faara ahu thlǝm Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝƙǝm Sǝsǝn Faar nǝm.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falama Faara tǝ fannun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Fingya ahur nun ndagha nda, “Walɗi kwamana na a ǝna ǝngya ni heu”, amma mbǝ ǝngya heu na ngga a fadwa wa. Ko nanǝn ƙǝm, “Walɗi kwaman ǝna ǝngya ni heu”, mbi tam tsaurha mafad komani wa. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Nduwun, “Ənagha anda ǝnnarhami ka hura, hura ƙǝm ka ǝnnarhami na Faara a ɓǝlang kanda kyab.” Əna wanda farha ka kulafayirha wa, amma a Chinǝm, Chinǝm kǝm ka farha. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Na faara a thleng ƙǝm sǝ hu mǝra tǝ sǝsǝmndǝghǝn, ƙǝla thleng nǝn Chinǝm sǝ hu mǝrra. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Sǝnggunsǝ fannun mbǝd njiya Ƙǝrǝsti ni wa? Ƙǝƙǝn na niifa tǝrang mbǝd njiya Ƙǝrǝsti tsawanggǝn mbǝd njiya susuwarha? Mbǝ tam ǝnaarha hai wa. <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Sǝnggunsǝ wa, kala niifa wumangga fadghǝn tǝ susuwarha, tsau nda farha tal wa? Ƙǝsǝr chirethleng nda hai, “Kanda kyab tsau nda farha tal.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Amma kala niifa wumngga teena tǝ Chinǝm, tsau nda tǝtal hu sǝsǝna. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Malaman kulafayirha, kala fingya ɗimiyirha na fiya a ǝnaarha tsuwar wa fad ndan fa wa. Amma fingya na a ǝna ɗimiyid kulafayirha, ǝnang nanda ɗimiyirha fandan fa. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Sǝnggunsǝ fad nun ƙǝn Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda ni na ahur nun fǝrang na Faara kun wa? Mbǝ yi altennun ni kun wa, amma a Faara, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />tiigha kaan aten nun. Tsaunǝn kee mana man thlǝm Faara tǝ pofad nun.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Tsaharhaha aten kakhrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Nanǝnya aten ɓillad nun chireethlee nun ɓa. Nǝghǝn ngga a tsuwar niifa nuneefa fa wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Amma ƙǝsǝr amana niifa kyarha hu ƙǝƙǝrra kulafayirha hai, kala hǝshneefa tsauka tǝ nukkun, tǝ ƙǝm kala nuneefa tsauka tǝ chimadghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Chimarha lǝɗanggǝn yighǝn ˈya kamngga yi kakhrha a nukkun, nuɗi ƙǝm waikee a chimadghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Ƙǝsǝr mbǝ nuɗi naarha tǝ sǝsǝmnda fadghǝn wa, kǝl chimadghǝn, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm chimadghǝn mbǝ naarha tǝ sǝsǝmnda fadghǝn wa kǝl nukkun. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />A ˈyaɗang ɗun fannun ndan wa. Ənamadghǝn tǝ nggǝmnda hur nun fa ɗǝgha hu sayi ɗǝ ngguchit, tǝnun kǝsang altennun ngga hu hwan Faara. Akwasamadghǝn a nggǝr wun parha hai ƙǝsǝr amawana Sheetan huk kun ka yamid ƙǝrǝssǝ nun. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Pǝrang ni ǝnggini kun ˈyahu shawara, mbǝ ngyahang ni kun sahai wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Andam na fiya heu ƙǝla nggi kwan. Amma kowunni ahur nun tǝ yighǝn fǝra fǝrang na Faara, niifa tal tǝ tur yanɗi fǝra ha ya, tahadghǝn ƙǝm tǝ tur yanɗi fǝra ha taarha. <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Aten fingya ɓalgha kula kakhrha tǝ fingya mǝrna chimayi ndan, niya ndang nda kanda a nggushi tsau nanda kula kakhrha ƙǝla nani. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Amma a mba nda a mbang ƙǝs alten ndan wa, kamɗǝ a kahaa nda amawa nanda kyarha hu susuwayirha hai. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Nafiya kakhka niya ndang nda kanda mbǝ laɓar altenna wa amma yi Chinǝm, ma ndǝk nuneefa hai tǝ chimadghǝn wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Amma a ndǝkɗa hai tǝghǝn, kǝl tǝta tsauka kee kula kakhrha, nduwa nggǝrgha nda tangsang mii ndan tǝ chimadghǝn. Chimarha ƙǝm a tamɗǝ kal nukkun hai wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />A fingya niya ndang nda kanda, mbǝ Chinǝm ndagha kee wa, ana yanɗi sǝ na tǝ nukkun fǝrwa wa ƙǝkafek tǝ Chinǝm a nggǝmɗa fa a tsauka tǝghǝn, a tamɗǝ kalghǝn hai wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Nuneefa ƙǝm natǝ chimarha fǝrwa wa ƙǝkafek tǝ Chinǝm nggǝmɗa fa a tsauka tǝghǝn, a tamɗǝ kalghǝn hai wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Chimarha fǝrwa kǝkafek tǝ Chinǝm nǝn a narha chahal ƙǝsǝr ka nuɗi keeghǝn, nuneefa ƙǝm fǝrwa ƙǝkafek tǝ Chinǝm nǝn a narha chahal a fad chimadghǝn. A mbǝ kewa mbǝ wanggiwa narha chahal wa, amma nanǝnya tsau nda chahal. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Amma ana mid chimadɗi nduwa nuɗi fǝrwa wa ƙǝkafek tǝ Chinǝm na midghǝn sǝ ndǝkrha hai tǝ ndan, malaman kanda ndǝgha nda hai. Tsaunǝn chimarha nduwa nuneefa na ƙǝrǝsta mbǝ tǝta ni a tsawa nda wa, ƙǝsǝr aana Faara ƙǝm a tsawun ɗǝɗem. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Sa nuneefa ƙǝƙǝn sǝnnasǝ na mbang hǝrghang chimadwa wa? Sa chimarha ƙǝƙǝn sǝnnasǝ na mbang hǝrghang nda nuwa wa?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsawu ƙǝla aah na Faara sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Kowunni ahur nun ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ tǝ tsaurha a mbǝɗi ɗǝfona Chinǝm sahai, tǝ ƙǝm tsawana ƙǝla kyana Faara ˈwa aah sa ɓa. Ənɗa pǝrang ni ƙǝn hwan Faarya heu. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Na niifasǝ ˈwagha teena thlee ɗǝ muwa a sayidɗi aah na ndan wa? A nggǝrɗǝ tsaurha kula thlee muwa wa. Na niifasǝ thleewa muwa a sayidɗi aah na ndan wa? A thlee ɗǝ muwa ɓal wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Mbǝ ˈyani thlee muwa wa, yamid thlee muwa ƙǝm mbǝ ˈyani wa. Takkwa ˈya ndana Faara ndǝn kamngga. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Kowunni ahur nun tsauka ƙǝla nanǝn a sayidɗi aah na Faara kun. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Mafarha ni sa a sayidɗi aah na nda sa wa? A ɓillad na wa. A nanna mbang wal kwaman altenwa, kaɗu. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ana mafarha ni sa a sayidɗi aah na Chinǝm sa ɓa, walna alten wa nanǝnya hu Chinǝm. A naa tǝ altenwa a sayidɗi aah na Chinǝm sa ɓa, nanǝnya mafad Ƙǝrǝsti ni sa. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Hiigha nda kun ɓa pǝɗaghǝn, nanǝn kee a tsauɗun mafaya fiya wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Shayina, koma nana niifasǝ a tsauka tǝ Faara ƙǝla nanǝn a sayidɗi aah nǝn ndǝn ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wutaraya tǝ nishya mǝrna chimayi ndan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Nanǝnya aten tsakh miiwa aten wutaraya ɓalgha kula kakhrha. Mbǝ ˈyasǝ pǝree na Chinǝm a thlǝghang nggi kanda wa. Amma Chinǝm ka haɗang ni fa fǝree ɗǝ sǝnda na fiya fǝrƙǝkafek tǝghǝn, ndǝn niya thlǝworha ya. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Ƙǝsǝr ka sǝsaarha nasǝ a weeriya, niyi a numarha a nggushi tsauna niifa ƙǝla nanǝn. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Ana kakhrha sǝ a atenwa, a ndǝk ɗun hai wa, A mbǝ kakhrha sǝ atenwa wa, a kaɗanna kakhrha wa.<verse eid="1CO 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Amma a kakh na ǝnawa ɗimiyirha wa, ko wutararha ni kakhka ǝnawa ɗimiyirha wa. Amma fingya kakhka na a kyarha hu ɓillarha hai hu tsawud ndan, nana minnasǝ a hǝrghang nggi kun hu ɓillad ɗiya. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />ˈYa niya thlǝkrha shayina, takhka ɓengya ngguchit. Nanǝnya ta mbeeɗǝ fingya kakhka na nda a tsaurha ƙǝla ˈwa wanda kakhrha wa; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />fingya na a tǝrha na nda tsaurha ƙǝla mba a tǝrha wa, fingya natǝ wutsǝfayirha fa na nda a tsaurha ƙǝla mba nda tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa wa, fingya hiigha ǝngya na nda a tsaurha ƙǝla mbǝ ˈyasǝ a har ndan na a ƙǝsa nda ha wa; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />fingya na mindan ǝn ƙǝshiirha, ɓa nanda naarha ƙǝla mbǝ ˈyasǝ na a ƙǝsa nda ha wa. Ƙǝsǝr ƙǝshidɗiya ƙǝla sǝn nǝm ndǝn nǝn a ngwalarha. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Na minnasǝ nduwun hai tǝ ɓillarha. Niifa mbuwa tǝ kakhrha nǝn ɓillarha kee tǝ ǝngya na mid Chinǝm, tǝƙǝm ƙǝƙǝn nǝn ǝnaarha na a tǝkka Chinǝm mbǝnda fa. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Amma niifa natǝ kakhrha nǝn ɓillarha tǝ ǝn ƙǝshiirha, ƙǝsǝr midghǝnsǝ na a tǝkka nukkun mbǝndafa, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />tsakh hutenggǝn hai sǝri. Nunefa mbuwa tǝ kakhrha, nduwa wutararha nǝn ɓillarha tǝ tar Chinǝm, ƙǝsǝr na midghǝnsǝ nagha chahal hu farha tǝ sǝsǝnggǝn. Amma nuneefa natǝ kakhrha nǝn ɓillarha tǝ ǝn ƙǝshiirha, ƙǝsǝr nǝn ǝna ˈya na a mbǝnanggǝn chimadghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Thlǝk ni ndǝn kee ka a ɗanggǝn kun sǝ, mbǝ a ndelth kunni wa, amma ka a nagha tsawud nun mǝmǝl kula tsakh huteena hai hu ǝnang taara Chinǝm. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ana niifa sǝ kaɗagha wee nuwun ka kakhrha, nagha ǝnang ˈya wutaradɗa fa mbuwa ngga har mbǝrgha sayid kahadghǝn ɗǝ, a ɓalgha midghǝn sǝ a kahanggǝn, nǝn mbang kahang nda, mbǝ ˈyasǝ ɗimi a hurghǝn wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Amma ana niifasǝ ƙǝm ishgha hu numadghǝn ngyahang ngwanda sahai wa, nǝn mbang ƙǝsang nda altenggǝn, mbǝ kakhrha wa, ǝnaɗǝ ngga. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Nanǝn kee niifa kahangga kyamadghǝn ǝnaɗǝ ˈya na ngga, yanɗi ƙǝm kahang ngwa wa ndǝn na mǝmǝl kaan. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />A ɓal chimad nuneefa hai tsauɗǝ nukkun. A mǝr chimadghǝn nǝn kal farha hai kakh niifa nǝn tǝrna midghǝn, amma a nggǝmɗǝ Chinǝm. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Amma hu numad na nǝn narha tǝ wutsǝfayirha a tsauɗǝ ƙǝla nanǝn, hu numad ƙǝm niyi tǝ Sǝsǝn Faara fa.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Hǝb ǝnnarhami pang nanda ɗaharha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Nanǝnya aten ǝnnarhami pang nanda ɗaharha. Sǝnɗǝmsǝ “Ƙǝm heu nǝghǝm tǝ huteena fa.” Amma huteena nǝn ɓang taala ɓa, nggǝmnda nǝn ɓang taksaarha ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />A tǝr niifa fadghǝn sǝnɗǝ ˈya, ɓalghǝn kula sǝn ˈyasǝ kamngga a sǝnggǝnǝn. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Amma kala niifa nggǝmngga Faara, sǝn Faara ndǝn. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Aten hǝb ǝnnarhami pang nanda ɗaharha, sǝnɗǝm sǝ hu ƙǝshidɗiya ɗaharha mbǝ a mii ˈya wa, tǝ ƙǝm mbǝ Faara sǝ pak wa, amma ƙǝl tǝtal kee. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ƙǝsǝr ko nanǝn na fingya sǝ na nda aarha faarya a talara tǝ hweeɗe, ƙǝla nanǝn na faarya sǝ hangga tǝ chinǝm ƙǝm hangga, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />amma a fad nǝm Faara tǝtali ni, ndǝghǝnni na Chinɗi ǝnagha ǝngya heu, ahurghǝn ni nanǝm sǝ. Ƙǝmɗa Chinǝm tǝtal ni kee, ndǝna Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, ahurghǝn ni ǝna nanda ǝngya heu, ahurghǝn ni ƙǝm nanǝm sǝ. <verse eid="1CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Amma mbǝ kala niifa na tǝ sǝnda ǝnɗiya wa. Fingya sǝsǝngga hai tǝ tar ɗaharha a hǝb nda ǝnnarhami na nda numad ndaarha ǝnnarhami ni pang nanda ɗaharha. Tsauna numad ndan mbǝ kuɗimnggǝn wa, na nda a naghǝn tsǝnda paarha fa hǝb nanda ǝnnadɗami, a mbǝɗiya na fad ndan mǝra hai. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ənnarhami mbǝ ɗang ƙǝm tsau thlǝmad Faara ɗǝ wa. A hǝb wum ndǝn wa mbǝ ˈyasǝ nǝm ƙǝɗeng wa, A hǝb ɗǝm ndǝn mbǝ ˈyasǝ nǝn chighang ƙǝm wa. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Amma kwarama naɗǝ tsawud alten ɗi kyanun ya kyathlang fingya hai mbuwa tǝ shembe tsawun ǝn kii saara a kanda. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ƙǝsǝr anad niifa sa, sa sǝngga ˈya a hǝb ǝnnarhami pang nanda ɗaharha, mbǝnǝn wal kaali a ƙǝɗi hutenggǝn hǝb ǝnnarhami ƙǝm Pang nanda ɗaharha wa? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Nanǝn kee ƙǝsǝr ka sǝnduwa shadwa mbuwa tǝ shembe a mǝra, kyana Ƙǝrǝsti mǝra ka ndǝghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ahu ǝnang ɗimiyirha shad nun fa kiya, ndǝ nun ǝnang ɗimiyirha Ƙǝrǝsti fa ƙǝsǝr ǝnang ɗun wundǝrha hutenggǝn fa ƙǝɗiigha. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Tsau nǝn kee, ana ˈya niya hǝbrha a kyang shadna hu ɗimiyirha hai, mbi tam nggǝr kii thluwa wa, ka amawa ni kyang shadna hu ɗimiyirha hai.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">ˈYa kamngga tǝ tar Tǝthlǝnda Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Mbiyi tsahai wa? Mbǝ tǝthlǝnda Yeeso ni nggi wa? Nawi Yeeso na Chinǝm wa? Mbǝ ƙǝsǝr ka tarna ni tsaunun yi Chinǝm wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />A mbǝ tǝthlǝnda Yeeso ni nggi a fingya wa, tǝthlǝnda Yeeso ni nggi a kun. Ƙǝsǝr kun ndǝn tsauka shedawa a tenna tǝ ndaarha nggi tǝthlǝnda Chinǝm ni. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Ənɗa ni nggǝrang fingya sǝ ya a tsahenda mee aten mamnggit na. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Kamngwa na a wal ǝnnarhami nan tǝ saarha a harnun wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Kamngwa na a wen hai tǝ nishyi nan ƙǝrǝsta kakh nan, ƙǝla fingya fathlǝngya Yeeso, tǝ wanmangya Chinǝm tǝ Mbiturus ǝnaarha wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Nduwa nggi tǝ Mbarnaɓa ni kee na ǝna taara hǝɓanggan fad nan wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Wunni ǝna tar sodja nagha a hǝɓang fadghǝn? Wunni hǝf hed inabi mbǝ kii wan ɗǝfyighǝn wa? Wunni tǝ chibrha, ƙǝɗenggǝn sa ɓithlaarha? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Nani a pǝrghǝn kee ka nggǝmnda hur niifa wa? Mbǝ kee ndaana ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai ahu ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa, “A pang na pupusa maɓi mii a sayidɗi na nanda a pǝr hwarma wa.” Ɓillagha Faara aten kwel kee wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Mbǝ nǝn a ndikrha aten nan wa? Ƙǝkafek ƙǝsǝr ka ƙǝmni chirethleng nanda hai. Ƙǝsǝr kamɗǝ yanɗi huɗagha tǝ yanɗi pǝrangga ɗǝ na nda a shiiten wal ǝnnarhami. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />A hǝf ɗan wid sǝsǝna ahur nun, mul nǝn hai a halth ɗan ǝnnarhami ƙǝla yi ƙǝshidɗiya a fad nun wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />A ɗang ɗun fingya sǝ pǝrangga laɓar Faara kun, kamngwa na a wal thlaara nan kal kanda nan wa? Amma ˈwa wan wal kwamana kee wa. A nggushi ƙǝrǝs nan tǝ kala ˈya nanan tǝghǝn ha heu ma tsawan fer kii saara a Laɓaara na mbǝnggǝn yi Ƙǝrǝsti.<verse eid="1CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Sǝnggunsǝ, fingya na a ǝna taara hu Ƙǝn Faara na nda wal ǝnnarhami hu Ƙǝn Faara wa, ƙǝmɗa fingya na a ǝna taara a mbǝd nji sataka a mbǝɗani na nda wal yi ndan hu ǝn sataka wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm, ndagha Chinǝm nafiya na a pǝr Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn a mbǝɗa ni na nda wal thlaara. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Amma nggi kam mbusǝ ko tǝtal ahur kwamanggini ya ǝnani taara sǝ wa, mbǝ ka nani a chireethleng hai a ǝneegha nda kee wa, ƙǝsǝr a nggushi mǝr ni ma ˈyaɗee taala nda fa tǝ tarna. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ko nanǝn pǝr Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn mbǝ ˈyani kamngwa a ǝna taala ni tǝghǝn wa. Tsaunǝn ndǝn kyana Faara fǝreerha a ǝnee. Ən kawa ni a fanna a pǝr wii Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn ya wa! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Andam niyi a ǝnaghǝn tǝ altenna kam niya wal tiirha. Amma mbi wura hasǝ wa, ƙǝsǝr Faara ndǝn ɗǝfeegha ndǝn hu haar na hai. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Mani ƙǝna tarna? Pǝr Laɓaara na mbǝnggǝn tǝka ni ǝnaghǝn. Mbǝ tǝ altenna niya pǝr Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn ya wa.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fǝr Mbulus fadghǝn ka a pǝr Laɓaara nǝn na mbǝnggǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ko nanǝn niyi tǝ altenna mbiyi a har niifa wa, tsauɗi mafarha a fiya heu ka a ɓanggi fiya ɓa hangga a thlǝma Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Anaɗi tǝ Yahudaya, tsawanggi fanna ƙǝla Tǝyahudarha ka a lǝmanggi Yahudaya thlǝma Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa. Anaɗi tǝ fingya na a takkwa ngyakhrha Yahudaya, tsawi ƙǝmɗa niifa na a takkwa ngyakhrha. Ko nanǝn mbiyi a takkwa ngyakhrha wa, ǝnani kee tǝni ɓang nafini na a takkwa ngyakhrha thlǝmad Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />A sayidɗi nani tǝ fingya mbuwa Yahudaya kanda mbuwa takkwa ngyakhrha, tsawi ƙǝmɗa ƙǝla yi mbuwa takkwa ngyakhrha tǝni ɓang kanda thlǝmad Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa. Amma karwi ngyahad Faara fa wa, niyi a ǝna taara tǝ ngyakhrha Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />A sayidɗi nani tǝ fingya ƙǝɗiina fǝrƙǝkafekkid ndan, tsauɗi ƙǝla kanda, ƙǝsǝr na minnasǝ a lǝmanggi fa yamid fǝrƙǝkafekkya thlǝmad Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa. Tsauɗi ƙǝla kala ǝngya turya fiya heu, ƙǝsǝr ko tǝ ƙǝƙǝn ni a hǝrghang nggi fingya. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Ənani ǝngya heu ka a pǝr Laɓaara ni na Mbǝnggǝn tǝni wal yina parka.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbulus mǝmǝlang ɗǝ fǝrƙǝkafekkid fatakkwaya tǝ yanda tǝ ɗaarha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Sǝnggunsǝ tǝ ndaarha ahu pǝpǝla ɗaarha kowunni nǝn kyarha hu ɗaarha hai wa, amma niifa tal ni kee na a hǝɓang nda wa? Nanǝn kee nama a ɗarha kee tǝnun wal ƙǝnaghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Kala nafiya na a ɓashad pǝpǝla ɗaarha na nda tsaharha ngga. Na nda ǝnaarha kee tǝna nda wal ƙǝnaghǝn mbuwa mǝnda ha, amma ƙǝm nǝm ǝnaarha kee tǝnǝm wal ƙǝnaghǝn yi na tsaurha pakwanɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Tsaunǝn kee, mbiyi a ɗarha kula mbǝrha niya ɗǝrha saɗǝ wa, mbiyi a yanda ƙǝla tǝ yanda tǝ ɗǝwumnda na ɗǝk ɓereurha wa. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Tsǝtsǝl ni fanna ne ƙǝla tǝ pǝpǝlad ɗaarha, na a tsaharha na a tsauka ka ˈya. A mbǝ kee wa, niyi a tǝrǝmnda akwasamadɗi pǝr ni laɓar Faara a fingya, nggi tǝ altenna ɓa nda rǝk nggi.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝs thlǝmarha aten takkwa ɗaharha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Shayina, mbǝ minnasǝ a tsauka kula sǝndǝnun wa, chichiyi nǝm kar wiigha nda heu akamu hashmbe, kya nda tǝ wuri aama. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Ənang nda mbaptisǝma kanda heu ka takkwa Musa ahu hashmbiɗi tǝ wuri aamɗi. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Kanda heu hǝb nda ǝnnadɗa mii na yi sǝsǝna, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />kanda heu ƙǝm san nda aamɗi na yi sǝsǝna. Ƙǝsǝr saagha nda aama ahu feera na yi sǝsǝna yanɗi wiigha tǝ kanda, ferɗi kǝm ya Ƙǝrǝsti ni. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Amma tǝkkwa Faara mbǝnda fa tǝ fingya wa, nanǝn kee ɓǝlangganda kanda pangganda kanda a mbǝya ɗǝɗamǝn a kaheerha. <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Nanǝnya katǝrana ǝnggina hai ya ka tsauka ǝnsakhrha aten nǝm, amawa nǝm ǝna tar mbǝlfeerha ƙǝla ǝna nanda. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Nanǝn kee a tǝrang shilee ɗahaya teena ƙǝla ǝnana fingya ahur ndan. Nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai, “Nafini tsau nda hai hǝɓa nda, saa nda, thlii nda sǝ ɓasha nda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyarhaɓa 32:6</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />A ǝnaɗǝm kulafayirha ƙǝla ǝnana fingya ahur ndan wa, kyangga fiya 23,000 hu mǝra hai paara tal. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Kamngwa a ƙǝƙǝrang nggǝm Ƙǝrǝsti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndagha fingya ɗeleewarya</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Chinǝm </char></note>, ƙǝla ǝnana fingya mǝr nanda ɗǝ ka ƙǝtta huthlingya wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />A huhurum ɗun ƙǝla ǝnana fingya wa, ɓǝlangna tǝthlǝnda Faara yi mǝra kanda. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Katǝrana ǝnggina hai tǝ kanda ya ka tsauka ǝnsakhrha a ƙǝm. Chireethleng nanda hai ka a ƙǝs thlǝmad nǝm nǝn ƙǝm ɓalgha hai hu ƙǝshiid weeriya. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />A numad na ish na ngga, kwaru naɗǝ fǝla hai. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Mbǝ ƙǝƙǝrra sǝ hu tsawud nun nanǝnya pak ma yanɗi ˈwana fingya saarha fa wa. Na Faara tǝ ƙǝkafek fa. Mbǝ fǝrang ƙǝƙǝrra kun kalgha kun mu wa. A wal ɗun ƙǝƙǝrra, nǝn kyaɗo kwaman kyarha sǝ tǝna ƙǝrǝsta.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaman wutsǝfayid ɗaharha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Nanǝn kee shayina kun nggǝmni, naama inggun ma takkwa ɗahaya. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Niyi a ndikrha tǝ nafiya na ndǝndǝl. Ƙǝlaman tafad nun ana ǝnɗi niya thlǝkrha ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Wuhuleu ɗi hwan nǝm Faara a ɗǝf parka nǝn sahai, mbǝ wum teena ni hur saa far Ƙǝrǝsti wa? Kii nǝm mburodi ɗi kyang nǝm hai, mbǝ nanǝm a tsau ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ fad Ƙǝrǝsti wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Ƙǝsǝr mburodi tal ni, ƙǝm na hangga farha tal ni, ƙǝsǝr ƙǝm heu nǝm a kii mburodi ɗi tal. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Numama aten nafiya Isǝreela. Mbǝ na nanda tal wumngga hai kiigha thlu sataka fǝr nanda a mbǝd nji sataka wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Ma niya ndaarha? Ənnarhami fǝrang nanda ɗaharha ndǝna ˈya wa, nduwa ɗaharha ndǝna ka ˈya wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Awo, niyi a ndaarha satakh kini ya, fǝrang nggandan ǝnkaheeya, mbǝ a Faara wa. Mbǝ minna sǝ ƙǝm non a wum teena tǝ ǝnkaheeya wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Mbun saarha tǝ wuhuleu Chinǝm nggǝr wun saarha tǝ wuhuleu ǝnkaheeya ƙǝm wa. Mbun hǝb ǝnnarhami a mbǝd hǝb ǝnnadmid Chinǝm, nggǝr wun hǝb yi ǝnkaheeya ƙǝm wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Nana mid nǝm nzǝwar mii Chinǝm tǝnǝn sǝrǝkrha wa? Kal nǝm ndǝn shembe wa?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nama a manang thlǝm Faara ƙǝtsar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Na fingya sǝ na nda ndaarha, “Malenda kwamana a ǝna komani” amma mbǝ ǝngya heu na ngga a fadwa wa. Ndagha na, “Malenda kwamana a ǝna komani” amma mbǝ komani na mbang ɗosǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />A ɓillad na tǝ ˈya na ngga a fadwa kee wa, amma numo aten ˈya na ngga a fingya fiya. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Nanǝn kee, kyama thluwa heu na nanda a heng ɗǝ hu kasu, kula kun tsakh mee tǝ ˈya karna mid nun. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Ƙǝsǝr ndagha Ɗeleewar Faara, “Ƙǝshiirha tǝ ǝngya na hurghǝn heu yi Chinǝm ni.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ana niifasǝ fǝrwa wa ƙǝkafek tǝ Faara aagha kun ka hǝb ǝnnarhami ɗǝ a minda keeghǝn na midwa sǝ a ɗǝna ɗǝ, hǝɓama kala ǝnnarhami na a mbed nun kula kun tsakhmee tǝ ˈya karna mid nun. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Amma a ndang niifa kun, “Ənnadɗami ya, yi pa ɗaharha ni,” a hǝb ɗun wa, ƙǝsǝr ka niifɗi pǝrangga ndǝn kun, ƙǝsǝr ka ˈya karna mid nun. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Niyi a ndaarha ka numad niifɗi aten ˈya na ngga tǝ mbuwa ngga, mbǝ yiwa wa. Kama na numad niifa ˈyaɗe wal altenna fa? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />A usaɗi Faara aten ǝnnad na mii, kama nda na nda thlǝk ˈya mbuwa ngga atenna ka hǝb ǝnnarhami usa ni Faara atenggǝn? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Nanǝn kee kala ˈya nun a saarha, nduwa hǝbrha, nduwa ˈya nun a ǝnaarha, ǝnamadghǝn heu ƙǝsǝr ka mamnggit Faara. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />A tsauɗun fer kisaara a Yahudaya nduwa fingya mbuwa Yahudaya, nduwa fatakkwaya wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Ənama ƙǝla niya ǝnaarha. Mbi ǝna ˈya na mbǝneeghǝn wa, amma ni ǝna ǝngya kamngga a mbǝnanggǝn fiya tǝna nda wal hǝrǝkrha.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Tsahama nggi ƙǝla tsaha ni Ƙǝrǝsti.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsaharhaha aten nggǝlanda teena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Niyi a fal kun ƙǝsǝr nun naarha ɗal nggi teena, ƙǝsǝr ƙǝsɗun tsahadɗaha tǝ ƙǝkafek ˈwani tsahang kun ha ƙǝla malang ni ndǝn kun ha. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Amma na minnasǝ a sǝnunsǝ turi hǝshneefa ndǝna Ƙǝrǝsti. Turi nuneefa ƙǝm ndǝna chimarha, turi Ƙǝrǝsti ƙǝm ndǝna Faara. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Kala hǝshneefa hwangga Faara nduwa thlǝkka ˈya kyadna Faara tenggǝn nggǝnggǝla sarang ɗǝ turighǝn ɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Kala nuneefa hwangga Faara nduwa thlǝkka ˈya ndaana Faara tenggǝn tsahai, sarang nǝn turighǝn ɗǝ nǝghǝn tal a thlǝrɗang ɗǝ tenggǝn ɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />A mbǝ mid nuneefa sǝ ƙǝnanggǝn tenggǝn wa, nǝn mbang tsaɗang was tenggǝn ɗǝ. Amma tsaunǝn ǝn shilee a fad nuneefa a tsaɗang ɗǝ was tenggǝn ɗǝ, nduwa thlǝrɗanggǝn ɗǝ, kamɗǝ a ƙǝnanggǝn tenggǝn. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Kamngwa hǝshneefa lǝlǝɓanggǝn wasghǝn wa, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn ƙǝla tǝ ƙǝm mamnggit Faara ni. Amma nuneefa nǝghǝn a kyad mamnggit hǝshneefa. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Kyawa hǝshneefa ɓa a fad nuneefa wa, amma nuneefa ndǝn kyaghǝn ɓa a fad hǝshneefa. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Əna wanda hǝshneefa ka nuneefa wa, amma ǝnagha nda nuneefa ka hǝshneefa. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ƙǝsǝr ka fathlǝngya Faara, a lǝlǝɓangga nuneefa tenggǝn a kyad ndaarha nǝn nǝghǝn a kamu sǝsǝmnda chimadghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Amma hu Chinǝm mbǝ nuneefa naarha katenggǝn kula hǝshneefa wa, hǝshneefa ƙǝm mbǝ naarha katenggǝn kula nuneefa wa. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ƙǝsǝr ǝnagha nda nuneefa a fad hǝshneefa, hǝshneefa ƙǝm nuneefa nggǝtgha ndǝn, ǝnggini heu ya Faara ndǝn ǝnagha ndǝn. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Ƙǝlaman tafad nun. Mǝmǝlni ana nuneefa a hwan Faara mal tenggǝnǝn tsahai? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ən tiina tsahang ɗa ndǝn ƙǝm ha tǝ ndaarha ǝn shilee ni ana was ten hǝshneefa hǝling. <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Nǝghǝn ngga a fad nuneefa ana was tenggǝn dzang, ƙǝsǝr fǝrang nanda wasa dzang ka a ƙǝnanggǝn tenggǝn. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ana niifasǝ na tǝ ngaala mii atenggǝn, mbǝ ǝna ˈya sǝ ɗǝɗamǝn hu ƙǝn hwan Faara wa.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝɓang nda ǝnnadmid Chinǝm ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Aten ǝngginiya, fal yi kun wa. Mbǝ ka ˈyasǝ ngga hu wum ndǝnun hai wa, nǝghǝn ka kee. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />A katǝradghǝn sǝkɗi ndaarha a wum ɗun hai hu ƙǝn hwan Faara nun kyad ɗǝɗamǝn nggirha, niyi a ndaarha nǝghǝn ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ƙǝsǝr tǝtani a nagha kyad ɗǝɗamǝn nggirha sǝ a pathlang nun, tǝna niifa sǝnang fingya hai na ahur nun na tǝ ƙǝkafek fa kaan. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />A sayidɗi wum nun hai heu a mbǝrha tal mbǝ nana mid nun ǝnnad mid Chinǝm wa, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />ƙǝsǝr a naɗun a hǝbrha fingya ƙǝl yi ndan kee ndǝn na nda ǝnaarha mii mba nda hǝbrha tǝ fiya wa. Nanǝn kee niifa tal tǝ miirha fa, niifa tal ƙǝm tǝrangga mbaala in. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Mbǝ wurayinun sǝ mbuwa nun hǝbrha tǝ saarha sǝ wa? Nduwa nun a fǝrang shilee fingya mbuwana ˈyasǝ a har ndan na ahur ƙǝn hwan Faara? Mani ndang nda kun? A fal kunni wa? Ƙǝkafek mbǝ ahu yanɗiya wa.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hǝb ǝnnadmid Chinǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ənɗi fǝrang ni kun ya, thlǝyi ndǝn ɓa a har Chinǝm, tǝ ndaarha, Chinǝm Yeeso a fǝɗikɗi fǝr na ndan tǝranggǝn mburodi sǝ, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />akwasamadɗi usa nǝn Faara, kyanggǝn hai, ndǝghǝn, “Fadna ni ya, fǝr nanda ƙǝsǝr ka kun. Nama naarha ǝnaarha kee tǝnun ɗal nggi teena.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm akwasamad ǝnnadɗa mii, tǝranggǝn wuhuleurha sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Wuhuleu ɗiya yi weerinda ɗǝfmiina ni tǝ kun ǝnana nda tǝ farna, nama naarha ǝnaarha kee ƙǝtsar tǝnun ɗal nggi teena.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kala fara kii nun mburodi ɗiya tǝ saarha tǝ wuhuleu ɗi ya, nanun a pǝr mǝrra Chinǝm ni ɗǝ, ƙǝl a nggǝr ɗǝ wutta ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Nanǝn kee, kala niifa kiigha mburodi ɗi ya, saagha tǝ wuhuleu ɗiya na yi Chinǝm kamngwa wa ǝnaɗǝ ɗimiyid sarang nda far Chinǝm ɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Ƙǝl ƙǝlang na niifa fadghǝn ngga kapa nǝn kii mburodi ɗi tǝ saarha tǝ wuhuleu ɗi. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Kala niifa kiigha mburodi ɗi tǝ saarha tǝ wuhuleu ɗi fǝrangwa mamnggirha Chinǝm, aang nǝn ngwa kumad Faara tenggǝn fa ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ndǝn ǝnagha ndǝn fingya ahur nun mba nda tǝ shembe wa, tǝ ƙǝm mba nda kanglang wa, fingya ma mǝr nda ɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Amma a ƙǝlang ɗǝm fad nǝm ngga ˈwan, mba nda ngwang kumarha ƙǝmsǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ana Chinǝm ni a ngwang kumarha ƙǝmsǝ, tsǝtsǝl nanda ƙǝm amawa nǝm mǝra heu tǝ ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Shayina, a wum ɗun hai heu kun a hǝb ǝnnarhami, ƙǝlama ndan hǝɓun heu. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Ana niifa sǝ na miirha a ƙǝsa, ǝna ˈya nǝn mii a wuri, amawa nun aang ngwa kumarha fad nun fa ɓa. Aten fingya ǝngya ƙǝm a ɓaɗiɓa ɓani kyaɗang kwamanggǝn kun.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Fǝrra Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Nanǝnya shayina aten fǝrra Sǝsǝna mbǝ minna sǝ a tsawun kutunggǝn wa. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Sǝnɗunsǝ sayidɗi nanun kun kula kyarha hu ƙǝrǝstayirha hai, sakh ɗang nda kun hu kwamangya hangga non a takkwa ɗahaya mbuwa kalasǝ. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Nanǝn kee na minnasǝ a sǝnunsǝ tǝ ndaarha mbǝ niifasǝ na Sǝsǝn Faara a shikƙǝn na mbang ndaarha, “Shiwang nda Yeeso wa.” Mbǝ niifasǝ ƙǝm na mbang ndaarha, “Yeeso Chinǝm ni,” ƙǝl nanǝn tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda. <verse eid="1CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Na tur fǝrra sǝsǝna sǝ ɗǝɗamǝn, amma Sǝsǝn ɗa ni tal fǝrgha ndǝn. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Na kwaman tǝr tarya sǝ hangga, amma Chinǝm tal ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Na tarya sǝ hangga, amma Faara tǝtal ni na shik kanda heu hu ko yanggi ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Kowunni ahur nǝm walɗǝ fǝrra Sǝsǝna ka a ɗanggǝn ƙǝmsǝ heu. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Na Sǝsǝnɗi fǝr laɓar thladwayirha niifa, a niifa pak ƙǝm fǝrang laɓar sǝnda nǝn. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Sǝsǝn ɗani na fǝrang fǝrƙǝkafek niifa, Sǝsǝn ɗani ƙǝm na fǝrang sǝsǝmnda niifa yi ƙǝnang nda haarha. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Na Sǝsǝnɗi fǝrang nda niifa sǝsǝmnda yi ǝna ǝnwultengya, a niifa pak ƙǝm fǝrang pǝr ǝngya kyad nǝn, a niifa ƙǝm sǝsǝmnda yi hwathlang nda Sǝsǝn Faara hai tǝ sǝsǝngya pak. Niifa pak ƙǝm fǝrang mbang ndikrha tǝ tur miiya ɗǝɗamǝn tǝ pǝr ˈya nda nanda tǝ tur miiya pak. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ənggini heu ya Sǝsǝn ɗani tal na a ǝnaghǝn tǝ ƙǝm fǝrang nggǝnǝn kowunni ƙǝla tǝrna midghǝn.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƙǝm heu farha tal ni tǝ mbǝd njiya hangga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Ƙǝla nana thlu farha tal, fadɗi ƙǝm tǝ mbǝd njiya hangga, ko nanǝn na mbǝd njiyini hangga, farha tal ni, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ƙǝsǝr ǝnangganda mbaptisǝma ƙǝm heu tǝ Sǝsǝna tal a tsawum farha tal, Yahudaya nduwa nafiya mbuwa Yahudaya, mafaya nduwa nafiya mbuwa mafaya, fǝrang nda Sǝsǝnɗi ƙǝm tal a sam. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Nanǝn kee mbǝ mbǝd njirha tal ni hu fadɗi wa, amma mbǝd njiya hangga. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Andam na saara a ndaarha, “Mbǝ haara ni nggi wa, mbiyi hu farha wa,” mbǝ nzang tsaurha fa mbǝd njirha hu fadɗi wa. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />A ndaa thlǝmaarha ƙǝm, “Tsaunǝn mbǝ yirha ni nggi wa, mbǝ mbǝd njirha ni nggi hu fadɗi wa,” mbǝ ˈyaɗang tsaurha fa a nagha mbǝd njirha hu fadɗi wa. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Andam farha heu yirha ni, ƙǝƙǝn na naa ˈya? A tsau fadɗi heu thlǝmaarha, ƙǝƙǝn na sǝk ˈya? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Amma fad nǝm heu nǝghǝn tǝ mbǝd njiya hangga, ɗǝfang Faara kala mbǝd njirha a mbǝrha na midghǝn tsauka sǝ. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ana fadɗi heu tǝ mbǝd njirha tal, na tahad fadɗi tsaurha ƙǝn? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ƙǝla nanǝn mbǝd njiya hangga ni, amma farha tal. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Mbǝ yirha ndang nda haara, “Njiɗewa ˈya tǝ sa wa.” Nduwa teena ndanggǝn sarya, “Njiɗewa ˈya tǝ kun wa!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Mbǝ kee mawa, mbǝd njirha nǝm a naarha mbǝ tǝ shembe wa ndǝn tsauka kadghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Mbǝd njiya nǝm a naa kanda ƙǝla ƙǝɗi shili ndan ma fingya, kanda ɗani nǝm fǝrang mamnggirha. Mbǝd njiya ƙǝm mbuwa nǝm a naarha nǝm laf kanda ngga. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Mbǝd njiya na ngga hu yirha mbǝ ˈyasǝ nǝm ǝnang kanda wa. Taksa Faara farha tsanggǝn fingya mǝd njiya mbuwa tǝ shilee fa na nda tǝ mamnggirha, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />tǝna wum teena naarha sǝ, na nda a laf ndan ha ngga. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />A wal mbǝd njirha tal wundǝrha fa, kanda heu na nda tǝk hattǝghǝn fa, a fal nda mbǝd njirha tal, kanda heu na nda ǝna wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="1CO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Kun heu fad Ƙǝrǝsti ni, kowunni ƙǝm mbǝd njidghǝn ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Kulo mbǝd njiya ya ɗǝfang na Faara kanda ahur ƙǝn hwan Faara, yi tal fathlǝngya Yeeso, yi sǝri ndǝna annabiya, yi mahan ndǝna fatsahaya ha, tǝ fingya na ǝna ǝnwultengya, tǝ fingya na tǝ fǝra yi ƙǝnang nda haya, tǝ fathlarya, tǝ fingya na a laf fiya hu ƙǝn hwan Faara, tǝ fingya na ndikrha tǝ miiya pak. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Fiya heu ni na fathlǝngya Yeeso wa? Fiya heu ni na annabiya wa? Fiya heu ni famalǝmngya wa? Fiya heu ni na ǝna ǝnwultengya wa? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Fiya heu ni natǝ fǝra yi ƙǝnang nda haya wa? Fiya heu ni natǝ fǝra yi ndikrha tǝ miiya ɗǝɗamǝn wa? Fiya heu ni na mbang kyakhrang ndikrha hai wa? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Amma a nggushi kukwasang na fǝra kun fa na mam, niya kyaɗang kwamana kun na ngga kalgha yanda mu ya.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kwaman nggǝmnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ko mbang ni ndikrha tǝ miiya yi fiya, nduwa tǝ yi fathlǝngya Faara, amma a mbǝ nggǝmnda sǝ ahur na wa, tsauɗi ƙǝla ndǝndolong nduwa huhoˈyok na riirha kee. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ko niyi tǝ fǝrra thlǝk ǝngya kyadna Faara, nggi a sǝnang kulish ǝngya hai heu, ne tǝ huteena fa, tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek fa ngga, ni mbang kyakhrang mbǝd tsawud wumnda hai, amma a mbǝ nggǝmnda sǝ ahur na wa, niyi mere kee. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />A fǝrɗi ǝngya nani tǝghǝn ha heu a fa yamiya, ko fǝrni fadna njegha nda ɗǝ tǝ yibrha, a mbǝ nggǝmnda sǝ ahur na wa, mbǝ ˈyasǝ chiye nǝn wa.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Na nggǝmnda tǝ ƙǝrǝsta fa tǝ nggayirha, mbǝ nggǝmnda sǝrǝkrha wa, mbǝ taala wa, tǝƙǝm mbǝ tǝrang altenggǝn sǝ wa, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />mbǝ naarha ngyangthlang wa. Mbǝ wurahasǝ wa, mbǝ hufrha hur wed wa, mbǝ ƙǝs ndan ha wa. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Mbǝ nggǝmnda ǝna wutsǝfayirha tǝ tar mbǝlfeerha wa, amma ƙǝl nǝn ǝna wutsǝfayirha tǝ ƙǝkafekkirha. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Nggǝmnda nǝn ƙǝrǝsta ko hu mani, tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek ko hu mani, tǝ shiteena ko hu mani, tǝ ndiyirha ko hu mani. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Mbǝ nggǝmnda tam ngwalaarha wa. Amma thlǝk ǝngya kyadna Faara, tǝ ndikrha tǝ miiya, tǝ huteena yi sǝnda heu ɓanǝn ngwalarha. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Ƙǝkafek lǝghǝdwa sǝndǝ nǝm wa, tǝƙǝm thlǝk ǝngya kyadna Faara mbǝ lǝlǝgɗa wa. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Amma a fara ɓana yanɗa ɓa na lǝlǝgɗa, yi mbuwa lǝlǝgɗa nǝn a mbǝraɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />A sayidɗi nani wundakhne, ni ndikrha ƙǝla wundakhne. Ni numarha ƙǝla wundakhne, sǝndǝna ƙǝm yi wundekhneyirha ni. Amma a sayidɗi shing ni, malang ɗi ǝn wundekhneyirha. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Nanǝnya nǝghǝm a naa ǝngya ƙǝla nǝm ƙǝlang kanda hu tolokar, amma na fara ɓayi ɓa nǝm naa kanda yirha tǝ yirha. Nanǝnya mbǝ sǝndǝ nǝm lǝlǝgɗa wa, amma na fara ɓayi ɓa nǝm sǝn ǝngya heu, ƙǝla sǝnna Faara ƙǝm ngga. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Nanǝnya tsau ǝnggini na mahan ya, ndǝna fǝrƙǝkafek, shiteena tǝ nggǝmnda. Amma yanɗi na manggǝn ahur ndan ndǝna nggǝmnda.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Thlǝk ˈya ndana Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ngwa tsauka nggǝmndǝ nun a mbee, tǝƙǝm kukwasangga fǝrra Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda kun fa, mbǝma ƙǝla yi thlǝk ˈya ndaana Faara wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Kala niifa na a ndikrha tǝ miiya pak mbǝ a ndikrha tǝ fiya wa, amma tǝ Faara, mbǝ niifasǝ na sǝn ǝnɗi nǝn a ndikrha wa ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn a thlǝk ˈya na ɓǝɓee tǝ sǝsǝmnda Sǝsǝna. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Amma yanɗi na a thlǝk ˈya ndaana Faara nǝghǝn a fǝrang shembe fingya, fǝrang kaali nǝn kanda, nggab kanda nǝn. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />A ndik niifa tǝ miiya pak, ɗang nǝn fadghǝn sǝ. Amma a thlǝk niifa ˈya ndaana Faara nǝn a ɗang ƙǝn hwan Faara sǝ tǝnǝn ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Na minnasǝ kun heu a ndiyun tǝ miiya pak, amma ndik ˈya ndaana Faara ndǝn tǝrna miina. Niifa na a ndik ˈya ndaana Faara kalɗǝ niifa na a ndikrha tǝ miiya pak, ƙǝl ana niifasǝ na a kyakhrang ˈya hai na a thlǝkrha tǝna fiya heu na ahur ƙǝn hwan Faara wal kaali. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Nanǝnya shayina a ɓaaɗi thlǝman nun ɓa ne a ndikrha tǝ miiya pak, ma nǝn chighang kun? Amma a ɓang ɗi ˈya kun ɓa keɗee na Faara, nduwa sǝnda nduwa ˈya ndee nǝn a thlǝkƙǝn ni nduwa tsahad laɓar Faara ha ndǝna ɗang kunsǝ. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Nǝghǝn ƙǝla ǝngya mbuwa tǝ yibrha fa ƙǝla nda mbǝmbeerha nduwa perima, ƙǝƙǝn na niifa kukwalang ǝnɗa hai na perima a ndaarha nduwa mbǝmbeerha mbǝ ƙǝl kyana urad ndan sǝ ɗǝɗamǝn wa? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />A kyawa pii kodwomnda sǝ kaan yi aah farha wa, wunni ngwarha fa a ka yanda ɗǝ? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Nǝn naarha kee tǝ kun ƙǝm. A ndik ɗun tǝ mee sǝngwa nǝm, ƙǝƙǝn na niifa sǝn ǝnɗi na a thlǝkrha? Na a ndikrha kee hu ɓereurha ɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Na tur miiya sǝ hangga hu ƙǝshiirha, kanda heu na nda ngga. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />A mbi a sǝk tur miiɗi wa, tsauɗi ronga a niifɗi na a ndikrha, niifɗi na a ndikrha ƙǝm ronga ni a fadna. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm tǝ kun. Tsaunǝn na fǝrra Sǝsǝna a kukwasang kun fa ƙǝl ndeng nun yid nun fǝr shembed nun nǝn tǝnun ɗang ƙǝn hwan Faara sǝ ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Nanǝn kee, kala niifa na a ndikrha tǝ tur miiya, ƙǝl a hwan Faara nǝn na a fǝrang sǝnda nǝn yi kyakhrang nda ˈya hai thlǝk nanda. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ƙǝsǝr a hwan ɗi Faara tǝ tur miiya pak, sǝsǝnna ni na a hwanda, amma sǝngwi ǝnɗi niya thlǝkrha wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nanǝn kee mani ǝnaarha? Niya hwan Faara tǝ sǝsǝna, niya hwan Faara ƙǝm tǝ sǝndǝna. Niya aah amshe tǝ sǝsǝna, niya aah amshe ƙǝm tǝ mee sǝnni. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Ƙǝsǝr a nanna a fal Faara ni kee tǝ sǝsǝna, ƙǝƙǝn na fingya sǝnang hai na a fal Faara heu tǝ kanda? Ƙǝƙǝn na nda wum teena tǝ sa hu usaarha tsaunǝn sǝnangwanda ǝnɗa hai na a thlǝkrha wa? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Usadna ngga, amma ɗangwa fiyasǝ na a sǝk sa wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Usaɗi Faara mbang ni ndikrha tǝ tur miiya pak ma kun heu. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Amma hu wumten fatakkwaya hai a nggushi thlǝk ni mee tuf sǝkƙǝna fiya ma thlǝk palthya ni haru kum tǝ miiya mbuwana fiya sǝkrha. <verse eid="1CO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Shayina, a numaɗun ƙǝla wundakhnaya wa. A meyedghǝn tsawama ƙǝla wufar waya hu tar ǝna mbǝlfeerha, amma tsawama tǝ numad shingya. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai ahu Ɗeleewar Faara, “Niya kalang nafina sǝ tǝ tur miiya pak, tǝ ɓarmi rongya. Amma ko nanǝn mba nda kee thlǝmarha fa wa.” Chinǝm ndagha kee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 28:11,12</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Ndikrha tǝ tur miiya pak ǝnsakrha ni, mbǝ yi fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya ni wa, amma a nafiya fǝrwa ƙǝkafek. Thlǝk ˈya ndana Faara yi fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya ni, mbǝ yi nafiya ni fǝrwa ƙǝkafek wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />A tsauɗǝ, wum fatakkwaya hai na nda heu a ndikrha tǝ tur miiya pak, ana rongya sǝ nduwa fingya sǝ fǝrwa ƙǝkafek kyagha ahur nun ɓa, mbǝna nda ndaarha kyaharna huten nun wa? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Amma anaɗun heu a thlǝk ˈya kyaɗang na Faara kun, tǝrgha fingya sǝ fǝrwa ƙǝkafek nduwa fingya sǝngwa ˈya na a katǝrarha hai kyanda hur nun ɓa, na nda a naa ɗimiyid ndan a pǝpal ngwang kumarha nda fandan sǝ tǝ ˈya thlǝk nun. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Na nanda a kathlǝmaarha hai ˈya na ɓǝɓee ahur ndan kyaɗǝ ƙǝshaaɓa, na nda ɓǝra hai tǝ waɗed ndan fǝrang mamnggirha nda Faara, ndanda “Ƙǝkafek Faara nǝghǝn ahur nun.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaman tǝrang shilee Faara in</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Nǝghǝn kee shayina, a wumɗun hai heu ka a fal Faara nun, niifa tal a aah amshe yi fal Faara, tal ƙǝm a tsaharhaha, tal a pǝr ˈya kyaɗangna Faara, tal a ndikrha tǝ miiya pak, tal a kyakhrang ǝnɗa hai thlǝk nanda. Amma ǝnggini heu ǝnanun ya tǝtani a chik kun heu nǝn. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ana fingya sǝ na ndikrha tǝ miiya pak, a tsauka nafiya sǝri, a paɗiɗa hai nafiya mahan. A nanda a ǝnaghǝn, ǝnaghǝnda tǝtal tǝtal, niifa tal ƙǝm a pǝr ǝnɗi thlǝk nanda. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Amma a mbǝ niifa sǝ a mbǝɗi na a pǝr ǝnɗi thlǝk nǝn wa, tsauɗǝ tǝta a nggasa nda tip ahu ƙǝn hwan Faara na midghǝn ndikrha tǝ miiya, a ndikka kee a fad ndan tǝ Faara. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />A nagha annabiya sǝri nduwa mahan na a thlǝk ˈya kyadna Faara, fingya ƙǝm a ƙǝƙǝrang ǝnɗi thlǝk nanda. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ana niifasǝ kyaɗangna Faara ˈya tsau hai, yanɗi ˈwagha katǝrang ndikrha hai nggasgha hai. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Hu kwamana kiya, kun heu na Faara kyaɗang ˈya kun tǝtal tǝtal, kowunni ƙǝm nǝn wal tsaharhaha tǝ fǝr kaali. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Ɗalama teena hai, annabiya na a thlǝk ˈya kyaɗangna Faara kanda na nda laf sǝsǝn ndan malang kwamana nda shayindan. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ƙǝsǝr Faara mbǝ yi tsǝ teena ni wa, amma yi tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha ni, ƙǝla nanǝn hu wumnda nafiya Faara hai na chahal. <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />A tsauka nishya tǝtip a wum fa takkwaya hai, mǝmǝlwa na a kala nda sǝ wa. Ƙǝl a fǝr altendan nda, ƙǝla ndaana ngyakhrha. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ana ˈyasǝ na mindan a sǝnggǝnda, tsahang mee nda chimayi ndan a wuri. Ƙǝsǝr ǝn shilee ni kalgha nuneefa sǝ hu ƙǝn hwan Faara. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Katǝragha laɓar Faara hai tǝ kun wa? Nduwa kun katen nun ni kee sǝl nǝn thlǝmad nun ɗǝ? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ana niifasǝ tǝrgha fadghǝn annabi ni, nduwa nǝghǝn tǝ fǝrra Sǝsǝn Faara, a sǝnggasǝ ǝnɗi niya chireethleng hai Faara ndǝn ndeegha kee. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />A kukwalangwa niifa ǝnɗa hai ya wa, ndǝghǝnggi ma mba nda a kukwalang hai ƙǝm wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Nanǝn kee shayina, a kukwasangga thlǝk ǝngya kun fa kyadna Faara, tǝƙǝm a ˈyaɗang ɗun ndikrha niifa fa tǝ miiya pak wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Amma tǝta ni a ǝna ǝngya nun heu ngga, tǝ ƙǝm mǝmǝl.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Thlid Yeeso sǝ hu mǝrra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Nanǝnya shayina, niya ɗalang Laɓarɗi kun in na Mbǝnggǝn ˈwani pǝrang nda kun, thlǝnun ish nun tǝghǝn ngga. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Hu Laɓar ɗani na Mbǝnggǝn ya nun wal hǝrǝkrha, a ƙǝsɗun laɓar ɗaha ngga pǝrang ni kun. A mbǝ kee wa, fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun mere ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />ˈYa thlǝni ɓa ndǝn pǝrang ni kun tǝ ndaarha, mǝrgha Ƙǝrǝsti ka ɗimiyid nǝm, ƙǝla ndaana Ɗeleewar Faara, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />pang nda, thlengganda sǝ hu mǝrra akwasamad ɓeena mahan ƙǝla ndaana Ɗeleewar Faara. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Kyadɗǝ fadghǝn a Mbulus. Tǝrgha a ɗǝgha kyad fadghǝn a kumkap sǝri ɗi. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Akwasamadghǝn, kyadɗǝ fadghǝn a shayinǝm kalgha haru tuf hu sayi tal, hangga ahur ndan ɓalgha nda hai, fingya ƙǝm shinda ɓeena. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Tǝrgha ɗǝgha kyaɗang fadghǝn Yakubu, tǝƙǝm a fathlǝngya Yeeso heu, <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />a mii ngwaladghǝn heu, ɓagha thlǝmad na ɓa ƙǝm, ko nanǝn niyi ƙǝla niifa nggǝt nanda hu sayi kamngwa wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ƙǝsǝr nggini ngguchit ahur fathlǝngya Yeeso heu, tsǝkki na a aah nggi nda tǝthlǝnda wa, ƙǝsǝr sǝsang ɗi fiya na a takkwa Faara. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Amma ƙǝsǝr ka nggayid Faara ni tsauni ƙǝla nani ya, nggayidɗi ǝne nǝn tsauka mere wa. Ənaɗi taara kaan kalɗi kowunni ahur ndan, ko nanǝn mbǝ nggini a ǝnaghǝn wa, amma nggayid Faara ni na tǝ nggi ha. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Yo, ko nggini nduwa kanda, naghan a pǝr laɓar Faara ni, ndǝghǝn ɗani fǝr nun ƙǝkafek.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlid mǝrya sǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Amma a pǝr nda laɓar Faara tǝ ndaarha thlid Ƙǝrǝsti sǝ hu mǝrra, ƙǝƙǝn na fingya ndaarha ahur nun mbǝ mǝrra thliirha sǝ wa? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />A mbǝ mǝrra thliirha sǝ wa, thliiwa Ƙǝrǝsti sǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />A thliiwa Ƙǝrǝsti sǝ wa, pǝr laɓar Faara nan a ǝnaarha mere ni, fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun ƙǝm mere ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Tǝrgha fǝr ɗǝm shedawa nggaɓang nda Faara fa, ƙǝsǝr ndaghǝm thleng Faara Ƙǝrǝsti sǝ hu merra. Amma mbǝ ƙǝkafek sǝ ahu ˈya thlǝk nan wa a mbǝ mǝrra a thliirha sǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ƙǝsǝr a mbǝ mǝrya a thliirha sǝ wa, ko Ƙǝrǝsti ni thliiwa sǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />A thliiwa Ƙǝrǝsti sǝ wa, fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun mere ni, ta weeri ɗa ɓa ya ɓal wun hu ɗimiyid nun. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Tǝrgha fingya ƙǝm mǝrgha hu Ƙǝrǝsti, mǝr nda ɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ana shiiten nǝm hu Ƙǝrǝsti nǝghǝn ƙǝla tsawud nǝm katenggǝn kee, nǝm kal fiya heu na a haɗangganda ƙǝm fa. <verse eid="1CO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Amma ƙǝkafek thleng nda Ƙǝrǝsti sǝ hu mǝrra, ndǝghǝn ni katǝra nakhɗa wan ɗǝfrha aten nafiya shiigha ɓeena. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Tsaunǝn kyagha mǝrra ɓa a fad niifa, thliirha sǝ hu mǝra ƙǝm kyaghǝn ɓa a fad niifa. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ƙǝla kyana mǝrra ɓa a fad Adamu, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm kala niifa tsauka yi Ƙǝrǝsti na nda a fǝrang yibrha. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Amma na nda a thleng kowunni sǝ tǝtakkwa, Ƙǝrǝsti ndǝna katǝra nakhɗa wan ɗǝfrha, a tǝrgha fingya na yighǝn a fara nǝn a wutta ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Tǝrgha akwasamadghǝn a ɓagha mii ngwaladghǝn ɓa, a naɗǝ a wuɗang kutǝryidɗi Faara ha na Chinɗi, akwasamadɗi weleng nǝn kutǝryirha ɗǝ, tǝ mamnggirha tǝ sǝsǝmnda. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Tsauɗǝ tǝta a ǝnagha Ƙǝrǝsti kutǝryirha ishanggǝn fatsanggighǝn hai tǝ sarghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Tǝsaara yi mii ngwalarha na nda a ɓǝlang ndǝna mǝrra. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ƙǝsǝr ndagha Ɗeleewar Faara, “Ɗǝfang Faara ǝngya heu a kamu mamnggitghǝn ɓa.” Ndanǝn “ǝngya heu na nda a kamu mamnggitghǝn,” Faara tafadghǝn mbǝ a hura wa, ndǝghǝn ni ɗǝfangga ǝngya heu a kamu sǝsǝmnda Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Tǝrgha, nana ǝngya heu a kamu mamnggitghǝn, Wanɗi ƙǝm nǝn a tsaurha a kamu mamnggit Faara, Faara fǝrangga mamnggirha Wanggǝn tsauka aten ǝngya heu, ndǝghǝn ni a tsaurha aten ǝngya heu ko a yanggini. <verse eid="1CO 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Nanǝnya a mbǝ mǝrya a thliirha sǝ wa, mana fingya yini ǝnaarha ǝnang nanda mbaptisǝma kanda a meyed mǝrya. A mbǝ mǝrya a thliirha sǝ sam wa, kama na nda ǝnang mbaptisǝma fiya ka kanda? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Kama nǝn kyang fad nǝm hu sǝsaarha hai ƙǝtsar? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Ƙǝtsar ni naarha ka ƙǝfarha tǝ mǝra, shayina, ƙǝla nanǝn ƙǝkafek ni naarha taala aten nun hu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso tsauka Chinǝm. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />A yanɗi tǝ maɓi heeya a Afisa, ahu shiiten niifa, ma chiye nǝn? A mbǝ mǝrya a thliirha sǝ wa, “Taama kim sam, ƙǝsǝr a ɓinda nǝm a mǝra!” <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />A huk nda kun wa: “Tsaurha tǝ fa mbǝlfeeya na nda sǝɓang ka niifa ɗǝ.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Wuɗaama hu numad nun ɓa na ngga, malaman ǝna ɗimiyirha. Ƙǝsǝr fingya ahur nun sǝngwanda Faara wa. Thlǝk ni ndǝn kee tǝna shilee ƙǝsang kun.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Weerinda fad nǝm a kwasamad thliirha sǝ hu mǝra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Amma na fingya a tsakhmee ndanda, “Ƙǝƙǝn na nda thleng mǝrya sǝ? Na nda thliirha sǝ tǝ tur yanggi farha?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Sa nura! ˈYa hǝf na mbǝ kyarha sǝ tǝ yibrha wa ƙǝl a mǝrɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />ˈYa hǝf na ƙǝm, mbǝ ndǝna kad ǝnɗi na a kyarha sǝ wa, wiirha ni kee, ko yi wan hwaliirha, nduwa tur wiirha pak. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Amma Faara ni na fǝrang farha wiirha ƙǝla tǝrna midghǝn, kala wiirha tǝ tur yighǝn farha. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Mbǝ thluwa tur tal wa. Fiya tǝ tur yi ndan, maɓiya tǝ tur yi ndan, wuɗikkya tǝ tur yi ndan, tǝngya ƙǝn tǝ tur yi ndan. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Na farha sǝ yi talara, na farha sǝ ƙǝm yi hweeɗe. Amma mamnggit yi talara pak, mamnggit yi hweeɗe ƙǝm pak. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Yanfara tǝ mamnggitghǝn, ndǝree tǝ yighǝn, wufǝlngarya tǝ yindan. Na mamnggit wufǝlngaara sǝ ƙǝm pak ma shadghǝn wufǝlngaara. <verse eid="1CO 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Na thlid mǝrya naarha kee. ˈYa hǝfang nanda hai nǝn mǝthla, ˈya thleng nanda sǝ ƙǝm mbǝ tam mǝthla wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Na nda hǝfang hai kula mamnggirha, na nda thleng sǝ ƙǝm tǝ mamnggirha. Na hǝfang hai kula shembe, na nda thleng sǝ tǝ shembe. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Na nda hǝfang hai hu thlufarha, na nda thleng farha sǝ hu sǝsǝna. Ana thlu farha sǝ, na farha sǝ ƙǝm yi sǝsǝna. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai, “Adamu katǝra nanda ǝnaarha, tsauɗǝ niifa tǝ yibrha.” Amma Adamu nggǝlgha mee ƙǝm ndǝna fǝr yibrha yi sǝsǝna. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Amma mbǝ yi sǝsǝna ni ˈwagha wa, yi thlufarha ˈwagha kapa yi sǝsǝna. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Katǝragha nda ǝna niifa hu ƙǝshiirha, tǝ pǝpǝr chehweerha; amma niifa yi sǝri ɓaghǝn ɓa a talara hai. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Fingya na yi chehweerha na nda ƙǝla niifɗi ǝna nanda tǝ chehweerha, fingya na yi talara na nda ƙǝla niifɗi na a talara. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Tsaunǝn nǝghǝm ƙǝla niifɗi ǝna nanda tǝ chehweerha, a fara sǝmǝn ɓa nǝm tsaurha ƙǝla niifɗi na a talara. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />ˈYa niya pǝrang kun shayina, mbǝ ǝnaarha hai thlufarha tǝ fara wal kutǝryid Faara nǝn wa, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm mǝthla mbǝ har langaad ˈya mbuwa mǝthla wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Kama thlǝmaarha hai, niya pǝrang ˈya kun na ɓǝɓee. Mbǝm a shiirha heu wa, amma ƙǝm heu na nda a kyakhrang ƙǝm hai, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />hu shibrha yirha, hu ngwala sǝk pii kodwomnda. A pinda kodwomnda, fingya mǝrgha na nda a thleng kanda sǝ tǝ farha mbuwa mǝthla, ƙǝm natǝ yibrha fa na nda a kyakhrang ƙǝm hai. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Fadɗi kyanǝm na mǝthla ya tǝta ni na a kyakhrang ngganda hai hu farha ɗǝ mbuwa mǝthla hai, farha na mǝra ƙǝm tǝta ni na a kyakhrang ngganda hai hu farha ɗǝ mbuwa mǝra. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />A kyakhrang nda fadɗa hai kyanǝm na mǝthla ˈyahu yanɗaɗǝ mbuwa mǝthla hai, tǝƙǝm fadɗi kyanǝm na mǝra ya kyakhrang ngganda hu yanɗaɗǝ mbuwa mǝra, a farɗa ni laɓarɗi na chichireethlee hai a lǝghǝtta, “Kal ndan mǝrra mu, ɓǝlang nda. <verse eid="1CO 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Sa mǝra kalwanda sa mu wa? Sa mǝra ai yar hafǝd wa?” <verse eid="1CO 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Ɗimiyirha ndǝna yar hafǝd mǝrra, sǝsǝmnggit ɗimiyirha ndǝna Ɗeleewar ngyakhrha. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Amma malaman usaarha tsauka yi Faara, fǝrangga kwaman kal farha ƙǝm mu hu Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Tsaunǝn kee, shayina nggǝmni, ishama ngga. A tsang ˈya kun fa wa. Ƙǝtsar nama yakh ǝna tar Chinǝm, ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗunsǝ taara nun a ǝnaarha hu Chinǝm mbǝ tsaurha mere wa.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Ɗang nda nafiya Faara sǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Nanǝnya aten tsakh mii nun aten wuɗǝɓǝla wumang nun hai a nafiya Faara na chahal a Urshalima. Na minnasǝ a ǝnaghǝnun mǝmǝl ƙǝla ndang ni nafiya Faara na a Nggalatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />A katǝra paara yi ɓeena mǝd kowunni ahur nun kaɗa ˈya nǝn, nagha a ɗǝfang ɗǝ kala ˈya wal nǝn ha, mbǝ ƙǝl a ɓaniɓa a wum ˈya nun wa. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />A ɓaɗiɓa niya thlǝn nafini nggǝmna hur nun wur nun, chireethleng ɗeleewar ni kanda sǝ a ɗǝnda tǝ yinun fǝra a Urshalima ɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />A naɗǝ mǝmǝl ni a ɗiyaɗǝ, na nda mbang mbu samadna.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwad Mbulus fa yi wii tala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Niya weng tala kun ɓa, akwasamadɗi weng ni chehweed Makidoniya hai, ƙǝsǝr niya kyarha tǝ Makidoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Asǝmha niya tsǝrha tsǝɓaku a kyanun, a naɗǝ a ǝnarha hai ngwalagha fegrha nggi a mbǝɗi, tǝnun ɗeerha sǝ kala mbǝrha niya ɗǝrha saaɗǝ. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Mbǝ nggǝmnda hurna ni a naɗi a mbǝriɗǝ nanǝnya naa kunni kee wa, na minnasǝ a nggǝm Chinǝm fa mǝniha a thlǝmad nun. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Amma niya naarha a Afisa ta far wutsǝfayid Pentikos ɗǝ, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />ƙǝsǝr inenda kwamana hai manggǝn yi taara na ngga, ko nanǝn na fa sarya sǝ hangga. <verse eid="1CO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />A ɓad Timoti ɓa, ngwa kal farha nǝn hai a thlǝmad nun, ƙǝsǝr ndǝghǝnggi ma nǝghǝn a ǝna tar Chinǝm ƙǝla niya ǝnaarha. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />A sar niifa ndǝn wa. Anaɗǝ a wutta thlǝmanna ɓa fǝraman ˈya nǝn a ƙǝsa ha ɓa, ƙǝsǝr niyi a ƙǝlaghǝn fa tǝ fingya shayinǝm. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Aten shadnǝm Apolos, fǝrang ɗi kaali na a ɗǝgha wal kun tǝ fingya shayinǝm, amma mbǝ midghǝnsǝ ɗǝgha wal kun nanǝnya wa. Nǝn a ɓaarha ɓa a walɗǝ kwamana.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mii ngwalad laɓar Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Tsawama nggungwa fa, ishun ngga hu fǝrƙǝkafek, non tǝ kaali fa tǝ shembe. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Kala ˈya nun a ǝnaarha ǝnamadghǝn tǝ nggǝmnda. <verse eid="1CO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Sǝnɗunsǝ tǝ ndaarha wuri Istifanus kanda ni ˈwagha thlǝ laɓar Faara a Akaya, fǝr nda fad ndan ka a ǝnang taara nda nafiya Faara na chahal. Hwanni kun shayina, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />fǝraman mamnggirha tur nafini ya, tǝƙǝm a kowun wumngga teena hu tarɗi ya tǝ sǝsaarha ka ndǝghǝn. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Ənaɗi wutsǝfayirha ɓana Istifanus ɓa tǝ Fartunatus, tǝ Akaikus, tsawee ɗafa ƙǝla kun ɓagha ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Ƙǝsǝr ǝn kaali ni a fadna kaan, ƙǝla nananda a kun. Tur nafiniya kamɗǝ a wal faala nda.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mii ngwala nda ǝn Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Ƙǝn hwangya Faara na a Asiya kanda a ndangˈya kun fa, nda Akila tǝ Mbǝrǝskila, heu tǝ fatakkwaya na wumnda hai a minda kya ndan kanda a ndangˈya kun fa kaan hu thlǝm Chinǝm. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Shayinǝm heu na a mbǝɗiya kanda a ndangˈya kun fa. Ndaman ˈya ndan fa tǝ fǝbrha yi nggǝmnda na chahal. <verse eid="1CO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />NGGI MBULUS NDƏNA A CHIREETHLENG NDA ƏNƊA HAI YA TƏ HARNA. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Ana niifasǝ mbuwa a nggǝm Chinǝm tsauɗǝ shiwang nda. Ɓoɓa, Chinǝm. <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />A tsauka nggayid Chinǝm Yeeso tǝ kun. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />A tsauka nggǝmndǝna tǝ kun heu hu thlǝm Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>